      "content": "it just feels like he's waiting for me. like we're on different sides of a glass wall and i'm just stuck on this side alone. sometimes i think it would be so much easier to just... not be here. to just close my eyes and be with him instead of fighting this every single day. it feels like there's no real way to fix the loneliness.",
